    Recomputes the effective branching factor and geometric chain sum, the herding
    lifts, the two-stage ddPCR normalization and the regulated-control geometric-mean
    artifact; checks the termination, fixed-strategy, reference-invariance, and
    canonical-projection vetoes and the fail-closed decision."""
